  "title": "Land Surface Temperature",
  "description": "Daytime and nighttime Land Surface Temperature (LST) derived from MODIS MOD11A2 v6.1 8-daily composites at approximately 1 km resolution, converted to degrees Celsius and gap-filled using the Weiss et al. (2014) method. Gap-filled 8-daily outputs are aggregated to monthly and annual ~5 km global raster products covering the full globe. Three variables are provided: daytime LST, nighttime LST, and diurnal temperature difference.",
